{"thread":{"threadID":4162,"boardID":117,"topic":"Changelog - 08.02.2017","time":1486583915,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1486661556,"lastPoster":"Road2Esel","replies":10,"views":547,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":13},"tags":[{"tagID":281,"name":"Community"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":984,"name":"deutsch"},{"tagID":1023,"name":"german"},{"tagID":142,"name":"gewinnspiel"},{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":295,"name":"knife"},{"tagID":1050,"name":"raffle"},{"tagID":862,"name":"skin"},{"tagID":208,"name":"ttt"}],"posts":[{"postID":61515,"threadID":4162,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Changelog - 08.02.2017","time":1486583915,"lastEditTime":1486589067,"editCount":2,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":13,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1486584214,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1486584382,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1486584412,"value":1},{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1486584482,"value":1},{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486586260,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1486586986,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1486588174,"value":1},{"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","time":1486588303,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1486588790,"value":1},{"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","time":1486592074,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1486645569,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1486646800,"value":1},{"userID":2507,"username":"Seriously?","time":1486733116,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br><strong>--- Jail Server ---</strong><br>- Das Verhalten von jeglichen Bällen bei mapbezogenen Spielen wurde stellenweise verbessert</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- Knife Server ---</strong><br>- The following maps were added to the server:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>35hp_glass</li>\n<li>35hp_prospect</li>\n<li>35hp_roll</li>\n</ul>\n<p>- Arms (in First Person) were added to the &quot;Donald Trump&quot; and &quot;Banana Joe&quot; player models</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- Minigames Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden zum Minigames Server hinzugefügt (danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1153-schockly/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Schockly</a> für den Vorschlag <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4160-cs-go-minigamemaps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">hier</a> + das gemeinsame Testen mit mir und ebenfalls <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/262-deagletrix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Deagletrix</a> für seinen Vorschlag <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4157-mg-map-vorschl%C3%83%C2%A4ge/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">hier</a>!)<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>mg_100traps_v4_1</li>\n<li>mg_arcs_multigames_csgo_v2</li>\n<li>mg_bob2</li>\n<li>mg_bobii_reborn_v2</li>\n<li>mg_colors_cube_v2</li>\n<li>mg_dev_galaxie_course_csgo</li>\n<li>mg_eparlana_multigame_csgo_v2</li>\n<li>mg_galaxy_multigames_v5</li>\n<li>mg_grands_multigames_v1_1</li>\n<li>mg_jump_for_gun_rd_v1</li>\n<li>mg_lines_course_v1</li>\n<li>mg_muna_course</li>\n<li>mg_redeemer_course</li>\n<li>mg_ski_mountain_v2_csgo_sp</li>\n<li>\nmg_swag_multigames_v5 wurde durch mg_swag_multigames_v7 ersetzt</li>\n<li>mg_synthwave_course_a1</li>\n<li>mg_the_factory_course</li>\n<li>mg_thesimpsons</li>\n</ul>\n<p>- Die Rundenzeit wurde nun auf von 6 auf 10 Minuten angehoben, damit Spieler die Chance haben, längere Course Maps zu beenden<br>- Verschiedene von Maps verlangte Servervariablen wurden aktiviert, somit ist es nun möglich, in verschiedenen Maps Spiele wie z.B. Fußball oder &quot;Explosive Balls&quot; zu spielen<br>- Sämtliche Bugs in Bezug auf !rank wurden behoben<br>- Zeit, bevor eine Runde startet, wurde von 5 auf 2 Sekunden runtergesetzt</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- TTT Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4156-ttt-jail-maps-vorschlage/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">auf Vorschlag</a> von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2185-ibo107/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Ibo107</a> und Überprüfung von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> und <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a> zum TTT Server hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\nttt_chess_and_tea\n</li>\n<li>ttt_princesscraft_beta4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>- Die Map &quot;ttt_spaceship&quot; wurde vorläufig entfernt, da auf ihr keine Waffen vorhanden sind. Sobald diese Map von mir editiert wurde, wird sie wieder auf den Server gemacht</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- Store ---</strong><br>- Die zwei folgenden Chat-Tags wurden im Store für den Preis von 300 Credits eingefügt:<br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></details><p><br>- &quot;Since 2012&quot; Trail wurde für den Preis von 1000 Credits im Store eingefügt, siehe Thread <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4141-donator-5-jahre-special/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">hier:</a><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><br></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p>Vielen Dank für die zahlreichen Vorschläge in der letzten Zeit, ihr helft Dream dadurch enorm!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61519,"threadID":4162,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1486584413,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1486584469,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Schönes Changelog, ich würde mich über mein Vorschlag mit dem Player-Model freuen, was ich dir in Steam geschrieben habe. Ansonsten wieder gute Arbeit.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61521,"threadID":4162,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1486584583,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486586276,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Coole Sache. Auch danke an dich, dass du die Vorschläge so schnell umgesetzt hast <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61523,"threadID":4162,"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","subject":"","time":1486587069,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>n1</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61524,"threadID":4162,"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","subject":"","time":1486588285,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Good Job <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61525,"threadID":4162,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1486588732,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1486588836,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Good Job  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span>  , and thanks for the new maps on knife server  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span>  !</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61526,"threadID":4162,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1486588834,"lastEditTime":0,"editCo